# The net of dots of a lamp's shadow on the hero's nape (../README.md): Xardas' tower, the hero in profile from 120 cm
# and from behind the ear from 60 cm, then the same two views with the lamps' shadow answer as colours (vsm study 4).
# A switch waits after the shot before it: the frame of a shot is taken a few frames later.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=3840x2160 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content root of the head> [switch=value] \
#     scripts/bench.sh reports/render-features/2026-11-14-lamp-stipple/tools/lamp-stipple.bench .bench/clean-<variant>
# @timeout 300
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
blink off
overlay off
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 2500
shot p120
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 60 140 1
wait 2000
shot b60
wait 400
vsm study 4
wait 1500
shot b60_class
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 2000
shot p120_class
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 300
